       |
       +--- Container A
       +--- Container B

Containers have their own Docker network/IP, separated from the host's network.

Host
Host Network
     |
  Container
The container shares the host's network, so there is less network isolation.
So remember:
Bridge → network isolation ✅
Host → no separate network isolation ❌


