restart
------------------
Used to restart a container automatically under specified conditions.

services:
  backend:
    image: my-backend
    restart: unless-stopped

Common options include:
no            Don't automatically restart the container. Container starts -> Application crashes -> Container stops -> ❌ Docker does NOT restart it   This is the default behavior.
always        Use this when you want a service to continuously stay running.
